# Input

```scss
@use "sass:list";

$flags:[true==false,foo==foo,false or true,true and not false];
.identifier-operators{equal:list.nth($flags,1);same:list.nth($flags,2);either:list.nth($flags,3);both:list.nth($flags,4);length:list.length($flags);}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@use "sass:list";

$flags: [true == false, foo == foo, false or true, true and not false];
.identifier-operators {
	equal: list.nth($flags, 1);
	same: list.nth($flags, 2);
	either: list.nth($flags, 3);
	both: list.nth($flags, 4);
	length: list.length($flags);
}

```
